<title>NEW ZEALAND: Firestone full-yr profit falls 41 pct.</title>
<headline>Firestone full-yr profit falls 41 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to Dec 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    4.24 vs 7.18</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   41.8 vs 70.8</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			   10.0 vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)	  20.0 vs 16.0 (+20c sp div)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    120.80 vs 122.42</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 6.34 vs 10.76</p>
<p>    Tax				     2.10 vs 3.57</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   10.14 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date April 24</p>
<p>Reg date April 18</p>
<p>    Ex div   April 21</p>
<p>Note - Firestone NZ Ltd is a tyre manufacturer.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
